OL,5,G0125 Motorway Cops: Catching Britain's
OL,6,G     Speeders
OL,7,     FA PC pursues a suspect who speeds
OL,8,     Fthrough residential areas before
OL,9,     Fcrashing into a parked car. And
OL,10,     Fpolice pull over an argumentative
OL,11,     Fdriver who stinks of booze.
OL,12,G0220 Police Interceptors
OL,13,     FThere's a blistering pursuit on
OL,14,     Fthe M1 as Interceptors chase a
OL,15,     Fvehicle veering across lanes,
OL,16,     Fpushing the speed to 115mph. And
OL,17,     Fwe follow the dog unit as three
OL,18,     Fcanine cops are trained.
